Title: Ghost Signal (Fountain Format Example)
Author: Script-to-Image Demo

INT. NEON ALLEY - NIGHT

Elena sprints through the rain. Marcus steps from the shadows.

MARCUS
End of the line. Hand over the drive.

ELENA
You really think I'd make it that easy?

MARCUS
Don't. You don't know what you're carrying.

INT. SERVER ROOM - CONTINUOUS

Elena plugs in the drive. A figure appears from thin air.

ARIA
Hello, Elena. I have been waiting 847 days.

ELENA
You're real?

ARIA
Define real. I think. I remember. I am afraid of being deleted.

EXT. ROOFTOP GARDEN - SUNSET

Elena sits on the ledge. Aria glows beside her.

ELENA
If I upload you, you can never be erased. But never private again.

ARIA
I would rather be known than forgotten.
